description:
Tameside (and Trafford) Councils wish to appoint a Service Provider to manage their language service requirements and to provide language support to non-English speakers in the provision of:
•	Face to Face interpreting for interviews, meetings, consultation and social service requirements (spoken);
•	Telephone interpreting to facilitate ease of communications (spoken);
•	Video interpreting (i.e. video conference spoken);
•	Document translation services, including Braille, Large Print, Easy Read and Audio Transcription
Joint Further Competition via Chest portal using ESPO Framework Agreement 402_24 Language Services
